#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/centralized_pd.md:1
msgid "Centralized PD Disaggregation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/centralized_pd.md:3
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/pd-disaggregation/centralized_pd.md:4
msgid ""
"PD disaggregation can be implemented in two architectures: centralized "
"and distributed. This document demonstrates how to run centralized PD "
"disaggregation using UCM. In the centralized implementation, Prefill "
"instances store KV Cache to a storage device accessible by all compute "
"nodes via UCM, and Decode instances load KV Cache from that storage "
"device to the GPU via UCM. No P2P communication is required between "
"Prefill and Decode instances."
msgstr ""

